neaking elements of the game in the hospital chapter.<br>Underpass: players will experience the shooting elements of the game in the underpass chapter.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Prop system</h2>All items in this game have specific functions and attributes. Players need to use them correctly to defeat enemies.",
